{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra Kingdoms </strong> is a popular online multiverse metaverse, combining MMORPG and P2E capability where players can build and manage their own kingdoms, explore vast lands, and interact with other players in real-time. It's known for its stunning graphics and engaging gameplay.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Kingdoms is a massively multiplayer online game (MMO) that allows players to create and customize their own kingdoms, explore vast lands, and interact with other players in real-time. Players can build and manage their own kingdoms, complete with castles, cities, and other structures, and engage in combat with other players or computer-controlled enemies. The game features a variety of activities, including crafting, trading, and socializing with other players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2691250?t=1759178010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691250/2853d720722f4635e3a7c00b482222b9ca85579d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759178010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691250/842e9aebf1d1e2e267531b48629d33bb3c39ef05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759178010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691250/842e9aebf1d1e2e267531b48629d33bb3c39ef05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759178010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"FANTASY VIOLENCE\r\nANIMATED BLOOD"},"detailed_description":"<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p>Beta release available now</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><st